quran[7]{c,v,t}:
  57,12,"On that Day, you will see the believing men and the believing women with their light spreading swiftly ahead of them and on their right. (They will be told:) ‘Glad tidings to you this Day: Gardens with flowing rivers beneath them, to stay there forever. That is the magnificent success.’"
  57,13,"On that Day, the male and female hypocrites will say to the believers: ‘Wait for us; let us have some of your light.’ They will be told: ‘Go back (to the world) and look for a light (there).’ Then, a (separating) wall with a gate will be raised between them. The inner side of it will contain mercy, and towards its outer side, there will be punishment."
  57,14,"They will call out to those (believers): ‘Did we not use to be with you (in the world)?’ They will say: ‘Yes indeed! But you caused yourselves to fall into temptation; you (eagerly) awaited (our destruction) and remained doubtful, and false hopes deceived you until the command of Allah arrived. Thus, the Deceiver tricked you about Allah."
  57,15,"So this Day, no ransom will be accepted from you (O hypocrites), nor from the disbelievers. The Fire is your abode. It is your ultimate refuge. What an evil destination.’"
  57,16,"Has the time not yet come for the believers that their hearts become humbled to Allah’s remembrance and the truth that has come down and not be like those given the Book before, such that a long time passed upon them that their hearts became hardened? Many of them were transgressors."
  57,17,"Know that Allah revives the earth after its death. We have clarified the signs for you, so perhaps you may understand."
  57,18,"Indeed, those men who give in charity, those women who give in charity and those who lend Allah a good loan—it will be multiplied for them, and there is a generous reward for them."
